IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. BRANCHCALL.
DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 01 RC PIC 99. 01 N PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
CALL 'SYNTHETIC' USING BY REFERENCE N RETURNING RC
 ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY 'ERROR' NOT ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY 'OK' END-CALL
IF N >= 5 DISPLAY 'HIGH' ELSE DISPLAY 'LOW' END-IF
IF RC = 0 DISPLAY 'NORMAL-RETURN' ELSE DISPLAY 'OTHER-RETURN' END-IF
GOBACK.
